<title>PAKISTAN: CRICKET-ZIMBABWE 195 ALL OUT AGAINST PAKISTAN.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ZIMBABWE 195 ALL OUT AGAINST PAKISTAN.</headline>
<dateline>LAHORE, Pakistan 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe were all out for</p>
<p>195 in 49.1 overs in the second of three one-day internationals</p>
<p>against Pakistan on Friday.</p>
</text>
